                        target="frus1944v04#pg_1157">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1944, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iv</hi>, p. 1157</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d705-f5" n="66" xml:id="d705-f5-content">
